Package: com.yourname.volumechordrecorder
Name: VolumeChordRecorder
Version: 0.0.13
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Description: SpringBoard-only recorder driven by a volume up/down chord: a quick press starts or
 stops an audio recording, holding past the configured hold time starts or stops video with
 selectable quality and an optional microphone channel. Voice recordings take a selectable codec,
 sample rate, channel count and AAC bitrate. Includes a recordings manager, haptics, and optional
 upload to Telegram.
Maintainer: yourname
Author: yourname
Section: Tweaks
Depends: mobilesubstrate
